      behind by that removal and, against 32px of section padding, forced
      the background table to 550+64=614px — 14px wider than the 600px
      body, which is how it was caught (measured 2026-08-18).

      Historical caution, kept because it is a measured Outlook behaviour
      and this block has not been re-sent since the spacer columns went:
      elements inside a background section were observed to misalign in
      Outlook unless their own left/right padding was 0. The overlay text
      and button below still carry 32px of their own, so confirm this
      block on the next EoA round.
