             color="#000000" (top of this file), so deleting it paints the countdown BLACK on the dark
             photo. It reads redundant only because the two <p>s below used to hard-code the same white
             inline — which is exactly what defeated the Text 3 Text Color control until 2026-08-18.
             The container now owns the colour; leave it owning it. -->
        <mj-text align="center" color="#ffffff" padding="0">
              <p style="font-size:32px;line-height:36px;font-weight:400;margin:0;">01&nbsp;:&nbsp;10&nbsp;:&nbsp;55&nbsp;:&nbsp;01</p>
