    <!-- START: Event Invite Block -->
    <mj-include path="./partials/green-rule-divider.mjml" />
    <mj-section css-class="text-block block" background-color="#F5FAF1" padding="16px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0">
          <p style="font-size:17px;">{user_data~First Name}, you're invited!</p>
          <h2><a href="https://www.example.com">The Great Northern Festival</a></h2>
          <p style="font-size:17px;">
            The Main Cinema<br />
            115 SE Main Street<br />
            Minneapolis, MN 55414
          </p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0">
          <p style="font-size:16px;">
            ❄️ Minnesota winters are long, but they also offer rare moments to
            pause, reflect, and reconnect. The Great Northern Festival embraces
            that spirit, using winter as a backdrop for meaningful gatherings
            that invite people to think differently about how we build
            community and inspire outdoor joy.
          </p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/green-rule-divider.mjml" />
    <!-- END: Event Invite Block -->

    <!-- START: Steps Block (photo) -->
    <mj-include path="./partials/green-rule-divider.mjml" />
    <mj-section css-class="text-block block" background-color="#F5FAF1" padding="16px 32px" data-fully-exclude>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0">
          <p style="font-size:16px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;1&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>Your photo(s) should capture how you experience a public outdoor space</b>&mdash;like a park, trail, schoolyard, or protected landscape.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;2&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>You can enter daily with a new photo through February 9.</b> Let them know you appreciate the chance to weigh in.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;3&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>TPL will select the top five photos.</b> You'll then have the chance to vote for your favorite finalist from February 11-15. Watch for the voting announcement on February 11.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;4&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>All five finalists will receive a TPL prize package,</b> and the one with the most votes will also win a TPL x ENO Giving Back hammock and a one-year AllTrails Plus membership.</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/green-rule-divider.mjml" />
    <!-- END: Steps Block (photo) -->

    <!-- START: Steps Block -->
    <mj-section css-class="text-block block" background-color="#F5FAF1" padding="16px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 16px">
          <h3 style="text-align:center;color:#39B54A;font-style:italic;">It's easy to send your comment&mdash;<br />just follow these simple steps:</h3>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 16px">
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;1&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>Share your name.</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-top:0;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;2&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>Thank [Agency Name].</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-top:0;">Let them know you appreciate the chance to weigh in.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;3&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>Say why this matters to you.</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-top:0;">Explain why it's essential that park interpretation reflects all of America's history&mdash;and why strong staffing and funding are needed to make that possible.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;4&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>Add your personal touch.</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-top:0;">Share a meaningful park memory or experience&mdash;something that helped you learn or feel connected.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#39B54A;color:#ffffff;height:20px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;border-radius:3px;">&nbsp;5&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; <b>Close with your request.</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;margin-top:0;">Call on the NPS to research, preserve, and share all aspects of our history&mdash;and to fund this work so these stories can be told.</p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button width="auto"
          href="https://www.example.com"
          align="left" padding="0 0 16px" color="#ffffff" background-color="#006837">LEARN MORE</mj-button>
        <mj-text padding="0">
          <p style="font-size:13px;line-height:19px;font-style:italic;">This button will take you to <a href="https://www.example.com" style="color:#39B54A;">[the public comment portal]</a>, the official site where you can send your comment straight to [Agency Name].</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <!-- END: Steps Block -->

